#: libs/dcraw/dcrawbinary.cpp:78
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Unable to find the dcraw executable:"
"<br> This program is required by %1 to support raw file formats. You can run %2 "
"without this, but you will not be able to view or edit any images in raw file "
"formats. Please install dcraw as a package from your distributor or <a "
"href=\"%3\">download the source</a>.</p>"
"<p>Do you want to continue starting %4?</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Dat Programm \"dcraw\" lett sik nich finnen:"
"<br>Dit Programm warrt vun %1 för de Ünnerstütten vun Roh-Datenformaten "
"bruukt.Du kannst %2 ahn \"dcraw\" starten, man denn laat sik Biller in "
"Roh-Datenformaten nich ankieken oder bewerken. Bitte installeer Di dat Paket "
"\"dcraw\" vun Dien Distributschoon, oder <a href=\"%3\">laad den Born daal</a>"
".</p>"
"<p>Wullt Du wiedermaken un %4 starten?</p></qt>"

